observed = "At revision 4a9dbd740 the build `make paxd-native-libs && CGO_ENABLED=1 go build ./modules/lxphost/` exited 2 (log /out/logs/build-1.log): services/agent/crates/layerx-types/build.rs rejected the regenerated address-table.md row `| LXP_ARBITER_REQUIRED | precompiles/common/lxp_errors.go:151 |` as lacking the five registry columns, so cargo build --locked --release -p layerx-programs-sandbox exited 101 and every cgo-linked Go build failed to find -llayerx_programs_sandbox."
